<div class="wrap block"><p class="eyebrow">Little notes from the hive</p><h1>{{ blog.title | escape }}</h1><div class="grid">{% for article in blog.articles %}<article class="card">{% if article.image %}<a href="{{ article.url }}"><img src="{{ article.image | image_url: width: 600 }}" alt="{{ article.image.alt | escape }}" width="600" loading="lazy"></a>{% endif %}<p class="eyebrow">{{ article.published_at | date: '%B %-d, %Y' }}</p><h3><a href="{{ article.url }}">{{ article.title | escape }}</a></h3><p>{{ article.excerpt | default: article.content | strip_html | truncate: 140 }}</p><a href="{{ article.url }}">Read the find →</a></article>{% else %}<p>No notes yet — the hive is busy writing. Meanwhile, browse the <a href="/collections/christmas-gifts">Christmas gifts</a>.</p>{% endfor %}</div><p class="muted">Good finds, clearly described. Little prices. Lovely finds.</p></div>
{% schema %}{"name": "Main Blog", "settings": [], "presets": [{"name": "Main Blog"}]}{% endschema %}
